{"lesson":"alg8-c2-s1-n7","count":14,"exercises":[{"number":"88","source_number":"88","group":null,"text":"88. 确定下列方程的次数：\na) $x^2+y^2-12=0$；\nb) $5x-6y-14=0$；\nc) $x^3-5x^2y^4+y^5-8y^3=0$；\nd) $x^2-5x^3y+y^4-1=0$；\ne) $x-xy=65$；\nf) $x^4-8x^2y^3+y^4=16$；\ng) $3xy=x(y+1)-5y$；\nh) $7x^8-12xy+y=7x^2(x^6+1)$。","figures":[]},{"number":"89","source_number":"89","group":null,"text":"89. 下列变量取值数对是方程$x^2-y+2=0$的解吗？\na) $x=1$，$y=3$；\nb) $x=0$，$y=0$；\nc) $x=-2$，$y=2$；\nd) $x=-1$，$y=-3$。","figures":[]},{"number":"90","source_number":"90","group":null,"text":"90. 求下列方程的任意两个解：\na) $x-3y=1$；\nb) $5x+y=2$；\nc) $x-xy=15$；\nd) $x^2+3y=1$；\ne) $(x-1)(y-2)=0$；\nf) $(x^2+1)(y-5)=0$。","figures":[]},{"number":"91","source_number":"91","group":null,"text":"91.\na) 证明：方程$(x+5)^2+(y-2)^2=-1$没有解。\nb) 证明：方程$(x-7)^2+(y+4)^2=0$有唯一解。","figures":[]},{"number":"92","source_number":"92","group":null,"text":"92. 作出下列方程的图象：\na) $2x-3y=6$；\nb) $\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{y}{3}=1$；\nc) $x=-4$；\nd) $y=2$。","figures":[]},{"number":"93","source_number":"93","group":null,"text":"93. 说明下列方程的图象是什么，并作出图象：\na) $(x-y)(x+y)=0$；\nb) $(x-3)(y+1)=0$。","figures":[]},{"number":"94","source_number":"94","group":null,"text":"94. 作出下列方程的图象：\na) $y=\\frac{6}{x}$；\nb) $xy=-12$。","figures":[]},{"number":"95","source_number":"95","group":null,"text":"95. 作出下列方程的图象：\na) $x^2+y^2=16$；\nb) $x^2+y^2=36$；\nc) $x^2+y^2=6\\frac{1}{4}$；\nd) $x^2+y^2=20$；\ne) $x^2+y^2=12$；\nf) $x^2+y^2=0$.","figures":[]},{"number":"96","source_number":"96","group":null,"text":"96. 写出圆心在坐标原点、半径等于下列各数的圆周的方程：\na) 2；\nb) 4.5；\nc) $\\sqrt{13}$；\nd) $\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}$。","figures":[]},{"number":"97","source_number":"97","group":null,"text":"97. 下列各点在圆周$x^2+y^2=144$上吗？\n$B(7,9)$；\n$C(10,7)$；\n$D(0,-12)$；\n$E(-8,4\\sqrt{5})$。","figures":[]},{"number":"98","source_number":"98","group":null,"text":"98. 写出圆心在坐标原点的圆周的方程，已知它分别经过下列各点：\na) $M(5,12)$；\nb) $N(-1,-3)$。","figures":[]},{"number":"99","source_number":"99","group":"复习题","text":"99. 用下列方程的变量$y$表示变量$x$：\na) $2x+3y=7$；\nb) $3x-5y=1$；\nc) $x+xy=10$；\nd) $xy-y^2-2x=1$。","figures":[]},{"number":"100","source_number":"100","group":"复习题","text":"100. 化简：\na) $\\frac{a^2+7a+6}{(a-3)^2-16}$；\nb) $\\frac{4b^2-7b-2}{81(b+7)^2}$。","figures":[]},{"number":"101","source_number":"101","group":"复习题","text":"101. 解下列不等式：\na) $P^2-10P+21<0$；\nb) $u^2-8u+16>0$；\nc) $q^2+6q+13>0$；\nd) $-m^2-2m-3>0$。","figures":[]}]}
